  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Fam 402.01 Requirements for Renewal of Certification. A person seeking renewal of certification as a family mediator shall:\n\n(a) Meet the eligibility requirements set forth in Fam 402.06; and\n\n(b) Comply with the application process set forth in Fam 402.02 and Fam 402.03.\n\nSource. #9672, eff 4-2-10; ss by #12507, INTERIM, eff 4-2-18, EXPIRED: 10-1-18\n\nNew. #12635, eff 10-2-18",
